                 "RSA/OCR/Clerical and commercial qualifications", "City and Guilds Certificate",
                 "GNVQ/GSVQ", "NVQ/SVQ - Level 1 - 2", "NVQ/SVQ - Level 3 - 5",
                 "HNC/HND", "ONC/OND", "BTEC/BEC/TEC/EdExcel/LQL", "SCOTVEC, SCOTEC or SCOTBEC",
                 "Other vocational, technical or professional", "None of the above",
                 "Don't know", "Refused")

